      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ithaca%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Moosewood Restaurant began as a 1973 collective, publishing vegetarian cookbooks that spread Ithaca’s culinary reputation worldwide.",
